   "title": "Pain over 3 months: which treatment matches THIS patient?",
   "lines": [
    "mostly a PROCESSING problem (sensitized nervous system) · goal = manage pain and function, NOT cure",
    "acute phase first: fully investigate and treat the injury, then early return to low-impact activity"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "g_all",
   "x": 45,
   "y": 138,
   "w": 964,
   "h": 60,
   "kind": "plain",
   "title": "Pick the drug by what the pain looks like",
   "lines": [
    "adjuvants before opioids · multimodal · start low, go slow · short trials"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "g_ref",
